		"tut_step1_body": "Use the left joystick to move across floating islands, and tap the ▲ button on the right to jump.",
		"tut_step1_title": "1. Move & Jump",
		"tut_step2_body": "Walk near any glowing door, stone clue, or altar and tap the golden Interact button at the bottom. Golden = Exit, Blue = Gravity Lift, Purple = Shift Room, Black = Alternate World.",
		"tut_step2_title": "2. Interact & The Four Doors",
